  "construction": "Native MLP1 product write encoded once by frozen candidate. Selected membership requires hash-selected group active at that position. Exclusive=active coverage1;shared=active coverage2;union=both. Subtract each decoded delta from native write, preserving native bias and all downstream computation. Freeze other gates/coordinates.",
